```

---

**`backend/src/routes/api.ts`** — All API route definitions
- **Fix 3**: Added auth guard to `/oracle/stream`:
```typescript
const providedKey = String(req.query.apiKey || req.header('X-API-KEY') || '');
if (!providedKey || providedKey !== getRuntimeApiKey()) {
    res.status(401).json({ error: 'UNAUTHORIZED' });
    return;
}
```
- **Fix 7**: Structured OLLAMA_UNAVAILABLE error code in stream catch block
- **Fix 11**: Wrapped `ensurePersonalityTable(db)` in try/catch:
```typescript
try { ensurePersonalityTable(db); } catch (e) {
    console.warn('⬡ PERSONALITY_DB_WARN :: table init failed, running with default profile:', e);
}
```

---

**`backend/src/services/providers/anthropicProvider.ts`** — Anthropic API model mapping
- **Fix 4**: Updated all deprecated model IDs:
```typescript
private modelMap: Record<string, string> = {
    'claude-3-5-sonnet-liberated': 'claude-sonnet-4-6',
    'claude-3-5-sonnet': 'claude-sonnet-4-6',
